From 8037ed16d60e0718b526866590eddb595a3a8368 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seb <sebastian.merz@web.de>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 22:15:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add LMS-faithful sync for squeezelite players

- use the aioslimproto SyncGroup (player<->server clock mapping, play
  points, coordinated start, steady-state drift correction)
- start synced playback at a common start instant (strm u) instead of
  pausing and unpausing with a fixed 200ms delay
- run drift correction once per group from the leader
- map the per-player sync delay setting to the LMS play delay
- remove the old average-elapsed-diff sync, pause_and_unpause workaround
  and the WiiM pause hack
